KINDS
[guard is a person].

DEFINE
[a guard named henry
 a device named brass bell].

START
[henry is calm
brass bell is off].

WHEN
[player attacks henry
<then> (change henry to angry].

WHEN
[player sounds brass bell
<then> (change henry to calm
<then> (change brass bell to off].

IF
[henry is angry
<then> (change brass bell to on].

IF
[brass bell is on
<then> (damage player].
